# Bandit Level 8 → Level 9

## Goal
The goal is to find the password for the next level is stored in the file data.txt and is the only line of text that occurs only once

## Commands used
-sort data.txt | uniq -u

## Explanation
- ' sort data.txt ' sort the data that within data.txt.
- ' uniq -u ' display only one line that occur only once.

## Result
Combining the command together I was able to retrieve the password to the next level

## What I learned
The use case of ' sort ' and 'uniq -u' commands to narrow down.
